      "originalText": "Kisibhi machine ko pata lagana hai ki dusri machine us netwrok ka part hai ki nhi to subnet mask wo pata lagake deta hai\ne.g. here laptop ko nhi pata mobile us network me hai ya nhi to Subnet mask pata lagakar deta hai ki mobile bhi network ka part hai",
